    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d396">

                <pb facs="0441" n="429" xml:id="pg429"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.24591/10–2545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Iran</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Murray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-25T19:00:00-05:00">October 25, 1945—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>601. Although Russian withdrawal from Tehran was advertised, it has not actually
                    taken place, British have informed American Military Attaché London. Emb’s
                    comments on this statement would be appreciated.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
